<title>USA: Omaha hogs $0.50/1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $0.50/1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 higher. Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    56.00</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Weak to 0.50 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    55.00-55.25</p>
<p>	    450-525 lbs    45.50-46.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    530-600 lbs 10 head 47.00-49.00</p>
</text>
